Mississippi QSO Party -- the 82 Mississippi counties, each its own multiplier.
Codes from the county table docs/ContestRules/QSOParties/Mississippi/MS-QSO-PARTY-Counties.txt (DXLog.net MSQP.txt; see its header).
All 82 codes and names agree with the sponsor's County Check List, MSQP-Counties.pdf in the same folder (checked 2026-11-18).
Names are the counties; each is the ADIF county name once blanks are dropped.
No county maps to the state: the rules count Mississippi counties as multipliers of their own for every entrant.
The nine Mississippi grids are NOT here: an FT4/FT8 QSO earns a grid on the prefix sheet (the class).
No INCLUDE here: an out-of-state entrant table holds only the counties (the host-area rule reads it).
No line of this header may hold an equals sign: the reader takes any such line as an entry.

